{"time": "20261117T172732Z", "think": "Quest over; give notes.", "command": "answer I am Ka-Deelith of the Toh-Reel-Ka. I set the three seal-stones in the Kings Gate (they stay there), and with Cuts-the-Old-Knot I killed the hydra Guardian of the Root in Guardian Hall. Its body holds treasure that I have not looted yet. A door at the far end leads to the Root and the Eye. I still carry Eye-Setting, Keystone, gold, poison and the rest. Final choice at the Eye: use it in place (heals every tree, dreams continue) or lift it (ends the dreams, about three in ten trees die, the order breaks). I promised Cuts nothing about it. Unverified: Cuts claims the order keeps sap-fed dreamers in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar and that Never-Writes-Twice lied and kept the key. I could not check this.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Guardian's Hall", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn.cuts-believed": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.root-guardian"], "heard": ["topic.mn01-name", "topic.mn01-trade-warrior", "topic.mn